---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Field Expedition - December | Apu Pitusiray | Primigenias 33 Institute" description="The Destiny Vector">
  <Header />

  <main class="page-main">
    <section class="page-header hero-bg-overlay" style="background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(10,10,14,0.7), var(--bg-dark)), url('/images/apu-pitusiray.png');">
      <div class="container text-center scroll-reveal">
        <a href="/en/eventos-presenciales/" class="back-link">← Back to Annual Program</a>
        <h1 class="page-title text-gradient-flame" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Field Expedition - December | Apu Pitusiray</h1>
        <p class="lead">The Destiny Vector</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container text-content-box glass-panel breathing-glow">
        
        <div class="detail-block">
          <h3 style="color: var(--accent-cyan);">Climate & Season</h3>
          <p>Onset of the light rains season. The Sacred Valley is adorned in a mystical, vibrant emerald green, coinciding directly with the December summer solstice—concluding Earth's geometric year.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="detail-block">
          <h3 style="color: var(--accent-gold);">Brief Mystical History</h3>
          <p>This colossal Apu is the central protagonist in the sacred myth of Pitusiray and Sawasiray—a legend of transcendent love, polarity, and transmutation that birthed the water fountains of the valley. It is a mountain of profound energetic polarization where masculine and feminine forces of the Andean cosmos converge in harmony. In Andean mysticism, Pitusiray is a Supreme Apu embodying the mystery of sacred union, intimately bonded with its companion peak, Apu Sawasiray.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="detail-block">
          <h3 style="color: var(--accent-orange);">Subjects of Work</h3>
          <p>This is the Final Integration Module of the Numerical Chart. Standing before the monumental symmetry of the Apu, the initiate harmonizes masculine and feminine polarities, inner essence, latent talents, and persona through numbers. You walk your path, witness your achievement, and firmly sustain your sovereign POWER.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center" style="margin-top: 4rem;">
          <a href="https://wa.me/51967747483" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
            Inquire Dates on WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-main { padding-bottom: 4rem; }
  .page-header { padding: 5rem 1rem; text-align: center; background-position: center; background-size: cover; }
  .page-title { font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 1rem 0; }
  .back-link { color: var(--accent-cyan); text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }
  .back-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .text-content-box { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem; border-radius: 16px; margin-top: -3rem; position: relative; z-index: 10; text-align: left; }
  .detail-block { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  .detail-block h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .detail-block p { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.8; }
</style>
